# The turn panel against the computer (vs-white-easy.5dr: you are White, 1. e4 e5 is on the board): the opponent section is the
# computer's last turn; after Nf3 and Submit it shows the computer's new reply; Undo takes the round back and the rows follow.
record ../records/vs-white-easy.5dr
wait 60
capture checklist-vs-start
ainodes 0            # the computer's search is frozen: the panel while it is the computer's turn
clicksq 0 2 g1
wait 30
clicksq 0 2 f3
wait 30
key ENTER
wait 30
capture checklist-vs-thinking
ainodes 400
waitai
wait 60
capture checklist-vs-replied
key U
wait 30
key HOME
wait 40
capture checklist-vs-undone
